msgid ""
"If you connect your scales through the IoT App, the\n"
"                            weight of the package will be set automatically "
"when\n"
"                            you do a \"Put in Pack\" operation.\n"
"                            <br/>"
msgstr ""
"Als je je weegschaal aansluit via de IoT App, wordt\n"
"                            het gewicht van het pakket automatisch ingesteld "
"wanneer\n"
"                            je op \"Inpakken\" klikt.\n"
"                            <br/>"

